{"path":"container/unordered_multimap/empty","title":"std::unordered_multimap<Key,T,Hash,KeyEqual,Allocator>::empty","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::unordered_multimap&lt;Key,T,Hash,KeyEqual,Allocator&gt;::</span>empty","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/unordered_multimap/empty","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Checks if the container has no elements, i.e. whether begin() == end().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> empty<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks if the container has no elements, i.e. whether <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the container is empty, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>The following code uses <code>empty</code> to check if a <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/unordered_multimap\"><span class=\"kw1303\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unordered_multimap</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> contains any elements:</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;unordered_map&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;utility&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/unordered_multimap\"><span class=\"kw1303\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unordered_multimap</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>,<span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> numbers<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Initially, numbers.empty(): \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> numbers.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    numbers.<span class=\"me1\">emplace</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">42</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">13</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    numbers.<span class=\"me1\">insert</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/pair/make_pair\"><span class=\"kw1105\">std::<span class=\"me2\">make_pair</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">13317</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">123</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"After adding elements, numbers.empty(): \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> numbers.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Initially, numbers.empty(): true\nAfter adding elements, numbers.empty(): false</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/unordered_multimap/size\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>size</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the number of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/empty\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>empty</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks whether the container is empty <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/unordered_multimap","title":"std::unordered_multimap"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::unordere